WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.232
Ban Chao led the Han mission to the Western Regions, and the king warmly hosted a welcome feast.

00:00:05.582 --> 00:00:09.542
The mission was small, yet every member stayed composed and calm.

00:00:09.892 --> 00:00:15.340
But after only a few days, the king's attitude suddenly turned cold, and the mood at the feast grew very tense.

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:19.962
Ban Chao showed nothing on his face, but in his heart he already understood most of it.

00:00:20.312 --> 00:00:25.544
At night, he thought quietly. He understood: the Xiongnu envoys must have arrived.

00:00:25.894 --> 00:00:30.382
He recalled the general's words before the journey, and a plan slowly formed in his mind.

00:00:30.732 --> 00:00:35.604
He gathered his brave men and spoke the famous words aloud: 'If you don't enter the tiger's den, how can you catch the tiger cub?'

00:00:35.954 --> 00:00:39.506
Hearing this, his men clenched their fists, their fighting spirit high.

00:00:39.856 --> 00:00:43.816
In the deep of night, they raised their torches and raided the Xiongnu camp.

00:00:44.166 --> 00:00:47.886
The firelight startled the whole camp, and the Xiongnu fell into confusion.

00:00:48.236 --> 00:00:54.284
At dawn, the king submitted again in awe. Ban Chao stood tall in the morning sun.

00:00:54.634 --> 00:00:58.762
And this saying has been handed down, reminding people to face challenges bravely.

